## 19.5 Initial high-level design

```text
Web / Mobile Client
        ↓
   Load Balancer
        ↓
Application Servers
   ├── User Logic
   ├── Follow Logic
   ├── Post Logic
   └── Timeline Logic
        ↓
  Relational Database
        ↓
       Cache
