## 19.6 Likely future bottleneck

Timeline generation may become harder than post creation.

Creating a post is mainly a write.

A timeline must:

- Fetch posts from followed users
- Order the posts
- Apply privacy rules
- Return results quickly
- Handle repeated feed reads
- Remain fresh

Possible future timeline strategies:

- Generate during reads
- Generate during writes
